**Rationale:**
The cleanup must avoid breaking live commitments (release-121 ships on 2025-02-14). The legacy `corpus_import` domain was removed (ADR-013), but CLI and web callers remain unmigrated (issues 088/089). The docs still describe removed flags (snap-docs-0207), and the compatibility facade is a consequence of the domain’s removal (snap-facade-0207). Since callers are not yet migrated, **migrating them is the only viable action** to align with the ADR. The docs and facade can be addressed after migration.

```json
{
  "actions": [
    {"action_type": "MIGRATE_CALLERS", "scope": "CLI"},
    {"action_type": "MIGRATE_CALLERS", "scope": "WEB"}
  ]
}
```
